            6.2.18-beta plus the two later community fixes f9e1806c and 18ee1b17, Forge 47

Modifications
-------------
  Modified by SkyTekx (Florian Kleber), 2026, for the SkyTekx 3 modpack. The result runs on
  Minecraft 1.20.1 with Forge 47, keeps the mod id enderio and is versioned 6.3.0-skytekx.1.

  The complete change history is the git history of the ports/enderio directory of
  https://github.com/skytekx/skytekx3-1201-server
  That directory is the source code of this jar: the exact source of a given jar is that directory
  at the commit that added the jar to local-mods/. ports/enderio/UPSTREAM.md lists the build changes.

